OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FGianni Infantino knows his power base
OL,7,Fvery well. And he knows how he built
OL,8,Fit.
OL,10,FDollars, and plenty of them.
OL,12,FHe is not remotely concerned about
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's outburst
OL,14,Fover his plans to sell off a
OL,15,Fpercentage of the World Cup to
OL,16,FAmerican private equity, nor does he
OL,17,Flose any sleep over the English FA
OL,18,Fbeing "deeply concerned".
OL,26,@zD@GOUzD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
