FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FIn fact, while Burnham's utterings
OL,7,Fmight well benefit his domestic
OL,8,Fpopularity agenda, he is just as
OL,9,Flikely to antagonise many countries
OL,10,Fwho see (and have done for quite a
OL,11,Fwhile) England as an entitled and rich
OL,12,Ffootballing nation.
OL,14,FSo unpopular is the FA globally, if it
OL,15,Fmakes too much noise about Infantino's
OL,16,Fplans it would almost certainly work
OL,17,Fin his favour.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FInfantino only needs a majority of
OL,7,FFifa's 211 associations to get his
OL,8,Fproposal through, and more than half
OL,9,Fwill be very tempted by a deal that
OL,10,Fquadruples the size of their hand-outs.
OL,12,FWhat's more the Fifa president is now
OL,13,Fholding a gun to his members' heads. A
OL,14,Fdramatic new future constructed in the
OL,15,Fshadows with members of the wider
OL,16,FTrump dynasty now has to be voted on
OL,17,Fby September 19.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FNo discussion, no due diligence, no
OL,7,Fconsultation, just a "yes I'll take
OL,8,Fthe cash" or "no I won't, because I
OL,9,Fbelieve the beautiful game is not for
OL,10,Fsale".
OL,12,FUefa has called an emergency meeting
OL,13,Fof all nations on Thursday.
OL,15,FSo, can Infantino's money-making
OL,16,Fexercise, which potentially changes
OL,17,Fthe entire football landscape, be
OL,18,Fdefeated?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FWell, it's tough to see how, without
OL,7,Fusing the bluntest of all weapons, the
OL,8,F"nuclear option", and that is for high-
OL,9,Fprofile nations, largely European, to
OL,10,Fboycott the World Cup.
OL,12,FAfter all, what serious investor would
OL,13,Fplough millions into a competition
OL,14,Fthat did not have Spain, France or
OL,15,Feven England taking part?
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
