CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FSources inside Uefa have told ITV News
OL,7,Fthat they have to work hard to find
OL,8,Fthe giant stick that beats down this
OL,9,Fplan, but given the fast approaching
OL,10,Fdeadline, quiet diplomacy seems an
OL,11,Fimprobable option.
OL,13,FInfantino says he is just taking his
OL,14,Fduties and responsibilities as
OL,15,Fpresident seriously, trying to expand
OL,16,Fthe global game and find more
OL,17,Fdevelopment money for all of his
OL,18,Fmembers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FBut why does he need private
OL,7,Finvestment in the first place, and
OL,8,Fwhat could it lead to?
OL,10,FFifa has significant riches already, a
OL,11,FWorld Cup that has just made an
OL,12,Festimated $15 billion (around #11.2
OL,13,Fbillion) and has reserves of $3
OL,14,Fbillion (around #2.2 billion).
OL,16,FPrivate equity partners would surely
OL,17,Fonly be pushing for greater commercial
OL,18,Fbenefits; for a return on their
OL,19,Finvestment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FThat inevitably means more
OL,7,Fcompetitions and more regularly, more
OL,8,Fteams involved, more tournaments in
OL,9,FAmerica, higher ticket prices,
OL,10,Fhydration (Ad) breaks enshrined, and
OL,11,Foverlong half-time shows.
OL,13,FWho knows where the financial
OL,14,Ftinkering might end and what it might
OL,15,Fdo to football as we know it?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FWhat impact would that have on player
OL,7,Fwelfare, the already cramped calendar,
OL,8,Fon international football in between
OL,9,FWorld Cups, the Euros or other
OL,10,Fregional competitions, on traditional
OL,11,Ffans, on broadcasters?
OL,13,FThere are many, many questions but the
OL,14,Fmost significant of those is how on
OL,15,Fearth did Infantino get this far
OL,16,Fwithout consulting any of his members?
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FIt is a seismic turn of events that
OL,7,Fthe man at the top is determined to
OL,8,Fdrive through, and given the lack of
OL,9,Fdiscussion about his proposals, some
OL,10,Fbelieve it has the whiff of legalised
OL,11,Fbribery about it.
OL,13,FIf Infantino ruled out all the
OL,14,Fconcerns that many nations have, and
OL,15,Fthose red lines were incorporated in
OL,16,Fany future deal, then it might be a
OL,17,Fdifferent proposition. But he hasn't.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FBoycotts aside, one other option open
OL,7,Fto opponents is to persuade a majority
OL,8,Fthat this is not the way forward, or
OL,9,Feven if it might be, they need to have
OL,10,Fa voice in the debate before voting.
OL,11,FThis is not an easy route.
OL,13,FOr alternatively, if a sizeable
OL,14,Fminority don't agree with what's being
OL,15,Fsuggested they can hope Infantino
OL,16,Finstinctively feels, with such a
OL,17,Fdegree of resistance, it's a plan
OL,18,Fthat's not worth pushing through.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785401296
OL,3,CCould a World Cup boycott defeat
OL,4,CInfantino's money-making exercise?
OL,6,FHowever, there is absolutely nothing
OL,7,Fthat Infantino has done recently in
OL,8,Fhis residency to suggest his proposed
OL,9,Fpath is one he'd be remotely hesitant
OL,10,Fto walk down.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
